Subject: [PATCH 16/63] add helper function to get qemu help string

Summary:
# Motivation:
To avoid using unsupported parameters we can check the help string of the qemu binary. This helps when a flag is not part of a support version or qemu hasn't been built with the correct dependencies.

Test Plan:
